# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ford_Fiesta
# Ford Fiesta Mk5 (BE256): unveiled 1 April 2002, production from 29 April
# 2002 to 2008. The best-selling Fiesta generation to date; the Fiesta was the
# most numerous car on GB roads by 2005 (1.26m licensed, DfT VEH0120).
#
# Colours: Moondust Silver, Tonic Blue, Panther Black, Magnum Grey. The paint
# names are the actual Ford offerings with their availability years (Moondust
# Silver 1991-2026, Tonic Blue 2004-08, Panther Black mica 1997-2019, Magnum
# Grey 2002-16). These are the four largest measured DVSA first-registration
# shares over the model's road years 2002-2008: silver 31.0%, blue 22.9%, black
# 17.7%, grey 11.4%. Red was the next measured colour at 7.5% and is not
# modelled.
#
# Dates are staggered per colour by observed road presence. Weights total 500,
# the 2026-11-15 anchor convention for the Fiesta (provisional; a central
# rebase follows), split 31.0:22.9:17.7:11.4.

